# ADR-0314 (F-34, F-45): BEGIN inside an open transaction is a protocol
# breach: one FAILURE, then the server closes the connection.
!: BOLT 4.4
!: AUTO HELLO

C: BEGIN {}
S: SUCCESS {}
C: BEGIN {}
S: FAILURE {"code": "Neo.ClientError.Request.Invalid", "message": "Message of type BeginMessage cannot be handled by a session in the IN_TRANSACTION state."}
S: <EXIT>
